# requirements/data-sources/archives.ears
capability: Archive access and acquisition
owner: data-sources
requirements:
  - id: DSI-001
    pattern: ubiquitous
    text: "The system shall access every archive only through ArchiveGateway with a declared dialect per source release."
    rationale: "One port, one canonical schema, one declared dialect per source (§8)."
    verification: test
    tiers: [T0, T3]
    status: draft
    traces: []
  - id: DSI-002
    pattern: event
    text: "When a dataset is acquired, the system shall record the rendered query text, source release, licence, citation, checksum, byte count and timestamp."
    rationale: "Every acquisition is auditable and replayable."
    verification: test
    tiers: [T3]
    status: approved
    traces:
      - "python/tests.contract.test_kernel_fakes.TestArchiveGateway::test_query_renders_text_and_a_stable_idempotency_key"
      - "python/tests.usecase.test_acquire_dataset::test_acquisition_records_query_release_licence_citation_checksum_size_and_time"
  - id: DSI-003
    pattern: unwanted
    text: "If a downloaded chunk fails checksum verification, then the system shall discard it, emit DatasetRejected and retry within the bounded policy."
    rationale: "A corrupted chunk must never become evidence."
    verification: test
    tiers: [T5]
    status: approved
    traces:
      - "python/tests.usecase.test_acquire_dataset::test_corrupted_chunk_is_discarded_rejected_and_retried"
      - "python/tests.usecase.test_acquire_dataset::test_retries_are_bounded"
  - id: DSI-004
    pattern: event
    text: "When an acquisition repeats an existing idempotency key, the system shall return the existing artifact without a remote call."
    rationale: "Repeat acquisitions are free and identical."
    verification: test
    tiers: [T3]
    status: approved
    traces:
      - "python/tests.contract.test_kernel_fakes.TestDatasetRepository::test_find_by_idempotency_key"
      - "python/tests.usecase.test_acquire_dataset::test_repeated_idempotency_key_returns_existing_artifact_without_a_remote_call"
  - id: DSI-007
    pattern: ubiquitous
    text: "Archive adapter contract tests shall run from recorded cassettes, and CI shall make no live archive call."
    rationale: "Live archives are rate-limited and change (ADR-015)."
    verification: test
    tiers: [T5]
    status: draft
    traces: []
  - id: DSI-008
    pattern: event
    text: "When the weekly live smoke detects a column added, renamed or retyped, the system shall fail the job and name the column."
    rationale: "Schema drift is caught within a week."
    verification: test
    tiers: [T11]
    status: draft
    traces: []
